<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Prompt templates</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Response Generation Prompt.</span> Here, we provide the prompts to generate model responses to questions from three domains.
For each model, we use its default system prompt as specified in the model documentation.</p>
</div>
