<div id="A1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Fallback Verification Prompt.</span> When Math-Verify returns unparsable or incorrect results, we employ LLM-as-judge as a fallback mechanism for correctness verification. Below, we provide the prompt template used for this secondary verification step:</p>
</div>
